### Terraform ###
# Local state (never commit — contains secrets & resource IDs)
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/terraform.tfstate
terraform/terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform/crash.log
# tfvars may contain secrets
terraform/*.tfvars
terraform/*.tfvars.json
# .terraform.lock.hcl should be committed for reproducible runs

### Frontend ###
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.env.local
frontend/.env.*.local
